*** SOLID Principal ****
S - single responsibility (Class must perform a single operation at a program)
O -  open and close principal (class must be open for extention but close for modification )
L - Libserve (operations must be perforemed on child class) * Confirm once
I - interface segregation (interface must perform a single operation at a program)
D - Dependency in version principal